+++ b/backend/README.md
@@ -1423,11 +1423,13 @@ for narrow screens; it has no links, scripts, remote resources, web fonts or
 tracking, and open and click tracking are requested off. The service message
 has no attachment field.
 
-**Logo — pending.** The official dark logo, inline as a CID image, is the
-approved delivery choice, but the derived 316 × 72 file needs the owner's own
-approval before it is integrated. Until then this build renders **no image**.
-The prepared integration, NOT applied, is
-`docs/qa/b6-stage2/logo/logo-integration.NOT-APPLIED.patch`.
+**Logo.** The official dark logo travels inline as ONE CID related part
+(`src/integrations/notifications/emailLogo.js`): the derived 316 × 72 file the
+owner approved, shown at 158 × 36 with alt text `Valida`, its bytes pinned by
+SHA-256 (`assets/SHA256SUMS.txt`) — a mismatched asset fails composition and is
+never replaced. File name and Content-ID are constants; nothing is fetched from
+anywhere. Only an HTML part that references the logo gets it; nothing else is
+ever attached.
 
 Tests: `tests/b6-stage2-templates.test.js` (T-01…T-12; part of `verify:b6`).
 Review fixtures and browser previews (not email-client evidence):
